Subject: [EXPERIMENT] ASoC: adapt the SP11 FullIO capture patches to next-20261120

Based on geocausa/SP11X1e-audio@3232e1dacdeb580a10a9cb8d4756a4518a7bd83e,
production capture patches 0072 and 0078 by SP11 audio reverse-engineering.
The source files are GPL-2.0-only. This patch has no speaker gain changes.
Requires the matching TX DMIC link and MicArray routing; not a standalone fix.

